        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Koitetab ibinwek che kigosiirto",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chu anyun ko ki werikab Daudi, che kigisikyi inendet eng’ Hebron: taita ko ki Amnon, ne kisich Ainoam Jesreelindet; ne bo aeng’ ko ki Daniel, ne kisich Abigail Jepkarmelyot; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne bo somok ko ki Absalom, weritab Maaka cheptab Talmai laitoriatab Gesur; ne bo ang’wan ko ki Adonija, weritab Hagit; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne bo mut ko ki Sepatia, ne bo Abital; ne bo lo ko ki Itream ne kisichei Egla osotiondennyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigisikyi lo eng’ Hebron; ak kilaitoran eng’ oloto kenyisiek tisab ak arawek lo: ak kilaitoran eng’ Jerusalem kenyisiek sosom ak somok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kigisikyi chu inendet eng’ Jerusalem: Simea, Sobab, Natan, ak Solomon, chuto ang’wan che kisichei Bat-sua cheptab Amiel:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak Ibar, Elisama, ak Elipelet; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak Noga, Nepeg, ak Japia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak Elisama, Eliada, ak Elipelet, chuto sogol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chuto tugul ko ki werikab Daudi, ko ma boto werikab chebaigeinik; ak ki chepkamenywa Tamar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak weritab Solomon ko ki Reoboam, Abija werinnyi, Asa werinnyi, Jeosapat werinnyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joram werinnyi, Aasia werinnyi, Joas werinnyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amasia werinnyi, Asaria werinnyi, Jotam werinnyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahas werinnyi, Hesekia werinnyi, Manase werinnyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amon werinnyi, Josia werinnyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak werikab Josia ko ki: taita ko ki Johanan, ne bo aeng’ ko ki Jeoiakim, ne bo somok ko ki Sedekia, ne bo ang’wan ko ki Salum. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak werikab Jeoiakim ko ki: Jekonia werinnyi, Sedekia werinnyi;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak werikab Jekonia luulenet ko ki: Sealtiel werinnyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak Malkiram, Pedaia, Senasar, Jekamia, Hosama, ak Nedabia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak werikab Pedaia ko ki: Serubabel, ak Simei: ak werikab Serubabel ko ki Mesulam, ak Hanania; ak Selomit ko ki chepkamenywa: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak Asuba, Ohel, Berekia, Hasadia, ak Jusab-hesed, chuto mut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak werikab Hanania ko ki: Pelatia, ak Jesaia: werikab Repaia, werikab Arnan, werikab Obadia, werikab Sekania. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak werikab Sekania ko ki: Semaia: ak werikab Semaia ko ki: Hatus, Igal, Baria, Nearia, ak Sapat, chuto lo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak werikab Nearia ko ki: Elioenai, Hiskia, ak Asrikam, chuto somok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak werikab Elioenai ko ki: Hodabia, Eliasib, Pelaia, Akub, Johanan, Delaia, ak Anani, chuto tisab.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
